<HelloFraandsPage title="Safety centre" summary="Surakshit baat karein, aur zarurat par madad lein." review={false} related={[]}>
<p>A good conversation starts with clear boundaries. Hello Fraands is for adults who want to talk to a real person. Use these guides to understand consent, report a concern, and find help.</p>
<h2>Safety guides</h2>
<div class="safety-cards">
<a href="/community-guidelines"><strong>Community guidelines</strong><span>What is welcome, what is banned, and what happens after a breach.</span></a>
<a href="/talk-safely"><strong>Talk safely</strong><span>Simple ways to protect your privacy on a call.</span></a>
<a href="/recording-policy"><strong>Recording &amp; consent</strong><span>Why calls are recorded and who may review them.</span></a>
<a href="/report"><strong>Report a user</strong><span>Tell us about a call or behaviour that concerned you.</span></a>
<a href="/grievance"><strong>Grievance redressal</strong><span>Contact the grievance officer and follow up on a complaint.</span></a>
<a href="/emergency"><strong>Emergency support</strong><span>Find crisis and mental-health support numbers.</span></a>
<a href="/women-only"><strong>Women-only space</strong><span>Who can enter and the rules inside the space.</span></a>
<a href="/age-policy"><strong>Age policy</strong><span>Our 18+ rule and age checks.</span></a>
</div>
<p>If you are in immediate danger, call <a href="tel:112">Emergency 112</a>. For mental-health support, call <a href="tel:14416">Tele-MANAS 14416</a>.</p>
